in, <br />\nAnd sin, we shall be free,<br />\nAnd perfect love and friendship reign<br />\nThro' all eternity. <span class=\"smallcaps\" style=\"font-variant:small-caps;\">Amen</span></li></ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&#32;\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw\u2010web.codfw.main\u201086855cfc48\u2010gqczg\nCached time: 20261021221419\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Header (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary\u2010page\u2010id, vary\u2010revision\u2010sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.120 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.189 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 588/1000000\nRevision size: 583/2097152 bytes\nPost\u2010expand include size: 17368/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5039/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 15/100\nExpensive parser function count: 2/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 2/20\nUnstrip post\u2010expand size: 10613/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.053/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1805218/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  174.833      1 -total\n 41.58%   72.702      1 Template:Header\n 29.38%   51.360      1 Template:Hymn/header\n 28.62%   50.045      1 Template:Music/header\n 20.76%   36.290      1 Template:Missing_score\n 14.77%   25.824      1 Template:Hymn/verses\n 14.06%   24.577      1 Template:Block_center\n 14.01%   24.503      1 Template:Pmbox\n  7.28%   12.728      1 Template:*!/s\n  5.98%   10.447      1 Template:Category_handler\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID c2ae75c4-cd9c-11f1-9066-73acf5813428 -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key enwikisource:pcache:1879212:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261021221419 and revision id 13800066. Rendering was triggered because: diff-page\n -->\n</div>"}}}